{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2a2","comment":"至此，形成五九炮过河车对屏风马平炮兑车的布局体系，这是中炮对屏风马布局体系中最常见的一种阵势，攻防变化十分复杂。今年\\u0022惠州华轩杯\\u0022全国象棋甲级联赛比赛局分计分方法为胜局2.5分：和局红方1分，黑方1.5分。因此棋手执先时，必然会选择复杂多变的布局以争取胜利：而棋手执后时，则采取以逸待劳的战术与红方抗衡。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"黑方弃卒意在对红方三路施加压力。近期流行下法是走炮7进5打兵，马三退五，炮2进5，以下红方有相七进五和马五进四两种选择，演变下去形成互有顾忌的局面。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b2","comment":"黑方走炮2进5是步很老式的下法。在上世纪70年代的上海市象棋比赛中，曾有业余棋手下过这一变化。由于黑方少卒，当时的实战效果不太理想，因此这一下法如昙花一现，再也没有出现过。现在一弘特大选择炮2进5的下法，我想赛前是有准备的。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5i7","comment":"黑方应走炮2平7兑子简化局势，试演如下：炮2平7，炮九平三，车2进9，马七退八，马8进6(如马8退9，车三进一，红方多兵占优)，车三进二，马6进7，兵五进一(如马八进七，车8进6，黑方谋和不难)，象7进5，黑方可以求和。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6h6","comment":"黑方如改走炮2退5打车，则兵三进一，车6进1(如车6平5，车三进一，马9退7，炮九平五，红方大优)，车八进七，车2进1，马二进四，炮7进2，炮九平二，红方优势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2h2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6h7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7g3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a3a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b8b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i2i6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a4b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i6c6","comment":"至此形成马